  "text": "This outfit is perfect for your morning yoga session and the coffee date that follows. The textured cappuccino cardigan gives you warmth without bulk, while the grey straight-leg trousers provide a clean line that elongates your figure. The brown teddy shirt adds a cozy, tactile layer perfect for autumn mornings. Your beige loafers offer comfort for standing or walking, and the suede tote complements the earthy tones while staying practical for carrying your essentials.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck the teddy shirt into the trousers to define your waist during yoga, then layer the cardigan over it when you meet friends.",
    "Leave the cardigan open to show off the warm brown tone of the teddy shirt underneath for a relaxed look."
  ],
