    {
      "n": "#35·00",
      "text": "A textured cappuccino cardigan with a ribbed collar and cuffs, featuring large pearl-like buttons down the front. The cable-knit pattern adds visual interest while maintaining a soft, cozy feel perfect for autumn mornings."
    },
    {
      "n": "#261·06",
      "text": "Grey straight-leg trousers with subtle pleats at the waist and a clean, structured silhouette that elongates the legs. The smooth fabric drapes elegantly without adding bulk, ideal for both movement and style."
    },
    {
      "n": "#44·39",
      "text": "A warm brown teddy shirt with a soft, plush texture and a relaxed fit. Its collar adds structure while the fuzzy material provides comfort, making it perfect for layering in cooler weather."
    },
    {
      "n": "#66·40",
      "text": "Beige suede loafers with a classic moccasin design featuring elastic detailing at the vamp and a low block heel. The smooth finish complements the textured fabrics of your outfit while offering all-day comfort."
    },
    {
      "n": "#568·21",
      "text": "A beige suede tote bag with a relaxed slouchy shape and long top handles. A small detachable pouch attached to the front adds a playful detail, while the soft material harmonizes perfectly with your cappuccino-toned cardigan."
    }
  ]
